      "summary": {
        "headline": "Advertising: long-term change in the published values, FY2000 to FY2025.",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "First-Class and Marketing Mail ads received per household (pieces per household per year) went from 643.6 in FY2015 to 378.0 in FY2025: it fell by 265.6 (41.3%) over the period. Since FY2020 (five years earlier) it fell by 109.7 (22.5%).",
            "metric": "ads-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2015,
              2025,
              2020
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Advertising mail received per household (pieces per household per year) went from 899.6 in FY2005 to 436.8 in FY2023: it fell by 462.8 (51.4%) over the period. Since FY2018 (five years earlier) it fell by 156.0 (26.3%). Since FY2013 (ten years earlier) it fell by 213.2 (32.8%).",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2005,
              2023,
              2018,
              2013
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Advertising mail per household (pieces per household per year) went from 673.5 in FY2014 to 393.0 in FY2025: it fell by 280.5 (41.6%) over the period. Since FY2020 (five years earlier) it fell by 109.9 (21.9%). Since FY2015 (ten years earlier) it fell by 265.9 (40.4%).",
            "metric": "advertising-per-household",
            "years": [
              2014,
              2025,
              2020,
              2015
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Advertising mail received by households (millions of pieces) went from 77,370 in FY2000 to 57,286 in FY2023: it fell by 20,084 (26.0%) over the period. Since FY2018 (five years earlier) it fell by 17,989 (23.9%). Since FY2013 (ten years earlier) it fell by 26,788 (31.9%).",
            "metric": "advertising-received-total",
            "years": [
              2000,
              2023,
              2018,
              2013
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Projection, not a published figure: the Linear trend model, fitted on FY2010 to FY2023, puts Advertising mail received by households at 49,387 in FY2028 (80% range 38,755 to 60,019). On past years it beat the naive baseline.",
            "metric": "advertising-received-total",
            "years": [
              2023,
              2028
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "First-Class advertising received (ads only) (millions of pieces) went from 9,471 in FY2000 to 3,236 in FY2023: it fell by 6,235 (65.8%) over the period. Since FY2018 (five years earlier) it fell by 268 (7.6%). Since FY2013 (ten years earlier) it fell by 1,004 (23.7%).",
            "metric": "fcm-received-advertising",
            "years": [
              2000,
              2023,
              2018,
              2013
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Projection, not a published figure: the Naive (last value) model, fitted on FY2010 to FY2023, puts First-Class advertising received (ads only) at 3,236 in FY2028 (80% range 2,658 to 3,814). On past years it did not beat the naive baseline.",
            "metric": "fcm-received-advertising",
            "years": [
              2023,
              2028
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Marketing Mail advertising received (millions of pieces) went from 60,496 in FY2000 to 51,942 in FY2023: it fell by 8,554 (14.1%) over the period. Since FY2018 (five years earlier) it fell by 15,739 (23.3%). Since FY2013 (ten years earlier) it fell by 22,423 (30.2%).",
            "metric": "marketing-mail-ads-received",
            "years": [
              2000,
              2023,
              2018,
              2013
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Projection, not a published figure: the Holt's exponential smoothing model, fitted on FY2010 to FY2023, puts Marketing Mail advertising received at 40,343 in FY2028 (80% range 27,631 to 53,054). On past years it beat the naive baseline.",
            "metric": "marketing-mail-ads-received",
            "years": [
              2023,
              2028
            ]
          }
        ],
        "caveats": [
